sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Client / User
    participant Coord as Coordinator Agent
    participant Bus as Message Bus & Audit Log
    participant State as Centralized Shared State
    participant Res as Research Agent
    participant Ana as Analyzer Agent
    participant Cri as Critic Agent
    participant Wri as Writer Agent

    User->>Coord: Submit Research Brief
    Coord->>State: Initialize SharedState & Set ExecutionPlan
    Coord->>Bus: Dispatch TASK_ASSIGNMENT (TASK-RES-002)
    Bus->>Res: Deliver Assignment

    Note over Res: Queries Corpus, Extracts Grounded Evidence
    Res->>State: Store ResearchFindings (Evidence Items)
    Res->>Bus: Emit RESEARCH_SUBMISSION
    Bus->>Ana: Forward Notification

    Note over Ana: Clusters Themes, Derives Insights & Correlations
    Ana->>State: Store AnalysisResult
    Ana->>Bus: Emit ANALYSIS_SUBMISSION
    Bus->>Cri: Forward Notification

    Note over Cri: Audits Citations, Flags Unsupported Claims
    Cri->>State: Store CriticReview
    Cri->>Bus: Emit CRITIC_REVIEW (Approved / Revision Request)
    Bus->>Coord: Forward Quality Gate Outcome

    alt Revision Required & Cycle < Max Revisions
        Coord->>State: Increment Revision Count
        Coord->>Bus: Emit REVISION_REQUEST to Target Agent
        Note over Coord,Cri: Iteration loop executes until Approved
    else Approved or Circuit Breaker Triggered
        Coord->>Bus: Dispatch TASK_ASSIGNMENT (TASK-WRI-005)
        Bus->>Wri: Deliver Assignment
    end

    Note over Wri: Formats Markdown Brief & Evidence Traceability Matrix
    Wri->>State: Store Final WriterReport
    Wri->>Bus: Emit REPORT_DRAFT
    Bus->>Coord: Forward Report Notification

    Coord->>State: Mark Workflow COMPLETED & Compile Telemetry
    Coord-->>User: Return Verified Enterprise Response
